flowchart TD
    Start([接收订单支付请求]) --> Validate{参数校验:payMethod枚举,RENT费项必传期号与金额}
    Validate -->|失败| ParamError[返回参数错误]
    Validate -->|通过| AcquireLock[获取分布式锁:outOrderId维度防并发支付]
    AcquireLock -->|失败| LockError[返回订单支付中错误]
    AcquireLock -->|成功| QueryOrder[SELECT tb_rent_order:订单状态]
    QueryOrder --> OrderStatusCheck{订单处于可支付状态}
    OrderStatusCheck -->|否| OrderStatusError[返回订单状态错误]
    OrderStatusCheck -->|是| BatchQueryInstallment[BatchQuery tb_rent_order_installment:按期号集合查期次]
    BatchQueryInstallment --> InstallmentCheck{期次校验:均待支付且到达plan_pay_time且金额等于应付减已付}
    InstallmentCheck -->|失败| InstallmentError[返回期次校验错误]
    InstallmentCheck -->|通过| TxBegin[开启事务]

    subgraph 支付单创建事务
        TxBegin --> GenTradeNo[生成outTradeNo商家侧支付单号]
        GenTradeNo --> InsertPayRecord[Insert tb_rent_pay_record:pay_status置处理中]
        InsertPayRecord --> BatchInsertPayItem[BatchInsert tb_rent_pay_item:费项明细]
        BatchInsertPayItem --> BatchLockInstallment[BatchUpdate tb_rent_order_installment:bill_status置为支付中]
        BatchLockInstallment --> TxCommit[提交事务]
    end

    TxCommit --> CallAlipayPay["调用：支付宝开放平台-alipay.commerce.rent.order.pay|租赁订单支付"]
    CallAlipayPay -->|成功| UpdateTradeNo[Update tb_rent_pay_record:回填trade_no]
    UpdateTradeNo --> RespBranch{payMethod响应分支}
    RespBranch -->|JSAPI| BuildJsapiResp[构建响应:返回tradeNo供前端my.tradePay唤起收银台]
    RespBranch -->|RENT_DEDUCT或PRE_AUTH| BuildAcceptResp[构建响应:支付受理结果]
    BuildJsapiResp --> AsyncNote[支付终态:由异步通知A0108001更新pay_status与期次已支付]
    BuildAcceptResp --> AsyncNote
    AsyncNote --> ReleaseLock[释放锁]
    ReleaseLock --> Success[返回成功]
    CallAlipayPay -->|失败| Compensate[补偿事务:Update tb_rent_pay_record置失败并BatchUpdate期次恢复待支付]
    Compensate --> ReleaseLockFail[释放锁]
    ReleaseLockFail --> FailResp[返回支付失败]
    ParamError --> End([结束])
    LockError --> End
    OrderStatusError --> End
    InstallmentError --> End
    FailResp --> End
    Success --> End
